## Step 2: কিভাবে চলে? (Flow)

```
bin/gulli (entry point — script চালায়)
    ↓
Gulli.run (lib/gulli.rb)
    ↓
┌─ FetchFeeds → Google Sheet "Feeds" tab পড়ে
│   Output: [{name: "nginx", url: "https://...", type: "rss"}, ...]
│
├─ Feed type অনুযায়ী collector select:
│   "rss"                      → CollectRSSArticles
│   "dependabot"               → CollectDependabotAlerts  
│   "google-artifact-registry" → CollectGoogleArtifactRegistryAlerts
│
├─ প্রতিটা collector → feed entry objects return করে
│   (RSSArticle, Dependabot, GoogleArtifactRegistry — সব Base-এর child)
│
└─ handle_announcement (প্রতিটা entry-র জন্য):
    ├─ known? → Sheet-এ আগে থেকে আছে? → skip
    ├─ 6 মাসের পুরনো? → skip
    ├─ ignore? (alpha/beta/rc?) → skip notification, but still track
    ├─ auto_jira_issue_create? → JIRA ticket
    ├─ remember! → Sheet-এ save
    └─ Notify → Slack message
```

