### 3.6 `lib/gulli/collect_rss_articles.rb` — RSS Collection

```ruby
def call
  xml = fetch_xml          # HTTP GET → XML content
  return [] unless xml     # error হলে empty array

  feed = Feedjira.parse(xml)   # XML → parsed feed object
  feed.entries.map do |entry|  # প্রতিটা entry → RSSArticle object
    rss_article_object(entry)
  end
end
```

**`fetch_xml`:**
```ruby
def fetch_xml
  client = HTTPClient.new
  client.ssl_config.set_default_paths  # SSL fix (Ruby-র known issue)
  client.get_content @url
rescue HTTPClient::BadResponseError => error
  # HTTP error (4xx, 5xx) → log + notify + return nil
rescue => error
  # অন্য যেকোনো error → log + notify + return nil
end
```

- `rescue` without class name → catches all `StandardError` (Python-এর `except Exception:`)
- Error হলে `nil` return → caller `return [] unless xml` দিয়ে handle করে

